      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ef7c68a92d7e814982c901fc0917414, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: Watching can be just as exciting as being on the field.
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb66605723840af4095c1cd31b791acd, type: 3}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Do you think asking Nanna to play too will help her feel better?
